 \"closed_trades\": [\n    {\n      \"order_id\": \"ORD-12344\",\n      \"side\": \"BUY\",\n      \"qty\": 0.001,\n      \"entry_px\": 63800,\n      \"exit_px\": 64200,\n      \"pnl\": 0.40,\n      \"won\": true,\n      \"opened_ts\": \"2026-06-19T08:00Z\",\n      \"closed_ts\": \"2026-06-19T09:30Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"strategy_history\": [\n    {\n      \"ts\": \"2026-06-19T07:00Z\",\n      \"from\": \"random\",\n      \"to\": \"momentum\",\n      \"reason\": \"loss_streak 5\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Key sections:**\n- **strategy**: Current algorithm (momentum/mean_revert/scalp/random) + params\n- **stats**: Wins, losses, PnL, streaks, total trades\n- **open_trades**: Active positions (order_id, side, qty, entry price)\n- **closed_trades**: History (most recent first, capped at 50)\n- **strategy_history**: When strategy switched (after 5-loss streaks)"}
