{"session_id": "wsess_8776db0a2b1a", "ts_start": "2026-06-25T08:55:45Z", "ts_end": "2026-06-25T08:57:15Z", "model": "qwen2.5:32b", "task": "Wren \u2014 pure-math helper functions for the new convergence gate. NO I/O, NO bus, NO async. Pure functions over belief dict + tick_buffer (list of recent prices, last-100 window already populated by belief_updater).\n\nFile to add them to: /vaults/nvme0/qsb_tower_v1/tools/belief_updater_math.py (append at end).\n\nSpec \u2014 4 dimension functions + 1 quorum function. Each returns (bool, reason_str). Spec:\n\n```python\ndef dim_regime(belief: dict) -> tuple[bool, str]:\n    \"\"\"Existing regime gate, packaged. True if regime_confidence >= 0.4.\"\"\"\n\ndef dim_trend(belief: dict, side: str = \"BUY\") -> tuple[bool, str]:\n    \"\"\"Directional drift agrees with side. BUY needs mean_retreat > 0; SELL needs < 0.\n    mean_retreat is in belief['regime']['mean_retreat'] (price-units-per-tick drift).\n    Tolerance: |mean_retreat| > 0.10 * step_std (must be meaningful drift, not noise).\"\"\"\n\ndef dim_volatility(belief: dict) -> tuple[bool, str]:\n    \"\"\"Step_std exists AND is in a sane band \u2014 NOT collapsed (regime shift dead) and\n    NOT exploded (chaos spike). Sane = step_std > 0 AND ticks_seen >= 30.\n    Reject if step_std is exactly 0 (cold stream) OR ticks_seen < 30.\"\"\"\n\ndef dim_cross_asset(belief: dict, peer_beliefs: list[dict], side: str = \"BUY\") -> tuple[bool, str]:\n    \"\"\"Correlated peers (e.g. EUR_USD + EUR_GBP both share EUR; BTCUSDT + ETHUSDT both\n    crypto) should AGREE on direction. True if AT LEAST 1 peer's mean_retreat has same\n    sign as ours, OR if no peers available (don't block on missing data \u2014 return True\n    with reason 'no_peers'). Side determines our expected sign (BUY = positive).\"\"\"\n\ndef convergence_gate(belief: dict, peer_beliefs: list[dict],\n                     side: str = \"BUY\", min_dims: int = 2) -> tuple[bool, str, list[str]]:\n    \"\"\"Quorum: call all 4 dims. Return (ok, reason, active_dims_list).\n    ok = True iff at least min_dims passed. Reason names the passing dims OR lists\n    missing ones with one-line per-dim status.\"\"\"\n```\n\nCONSTRAINTS:\n- import only math (no I/O, no time, no bus)\n- under 60 lines TOTAL for all 5 functions\n- match the style of existing functions in belief_updater_math.py (returns tuple[bool, str])\n- pass-on-uncertain \u2014 if data missing (e.g. no peers, ticks_seen low), prefer to PASS rather than block, except for dim_volatility which BLOCKS if cold-stream (we want quality entries, not cold-start opens)\n\nDELIVERABLE: just the 5 function bodies, ready to append to belief_updater_math.py. No tests, no commentary, just the code.", "turns": 1, "tool_calls": [], "wall_seconds": 90.09, "final_text": "ERROR: ollama call failed: timed out"}
{"session_id": "wsess_7c240733f066", "ts_start": "2026-06-25T10:19:18Z", "ts_end": "2026-06-25T10:21:56Z", "model": "qwen2.5:32b", "task": "Ross saw a TikTok by @cryptoteknikal_id showing a LIVE FLOW-DIAGRAM with STREAMING WAVEFORMS for AI trading signals (think: roman-rr/trading-skills style \u2014 the \"signal fires\" animation as triggers converge). He wants us to add this to our existing dashboard.\n\nCURRENT STATE:\n- Dashboard at http://127.0.0.1:8847/ (server: tools/qsb_traders_live_serve.py, page: web/traders_live/index.html)\n- Already polls /api/traders_live every 2s\n- We JUST shipped: \ud83c\udfaf Convergence panel showing per-worker 4-of-4 dim status (regime/trend/volatility/cross_asset), score bar, pulse animation\n- 93 workers tracked, 35 firing 4-of-4 dims\n- Convergence data published in /api/traders_live \u2192 convergence[] array per refresh\n- belief_updater publishes belief.updated events with regime_confidence, win_rate, n_trades, ticks_seen\n\nWHAT ROSS WANTS:\nA LIVE STREAMING FLOW DIAGRAM / WAVEFORMS panel. Picture a multi-track signal-flow visualization where:\n- Each track = one orthogonal dimension (regime / trend / volatility / cross_asset) OR one top-firing worker\n- Waveform RIPPLES across the panel left-to-right as new ticks arrive\n- When dims align (convergence fires), the waveform pulses GREEN or shows a connecting flow line\n- Animation: smooth, not jittery \u2014 60fps via requestAnimationFrame, NOT setInterval\n- Match existing dark-monospace dashboard aesthetic (--bg #050913, --green #44ad6a, --red #ff5050, --accent #88f0d8, --frame rgba(80,220,180,0.30))\n\nDESIGN QUESTIONS (please confer + give independent take on each):\n\n1. WHAT EXACTLY DO WE STREAM? Options:\n   (a) Per-dim activation count over time (4 tracks, each = ratio of workers passing that dim, rolling)\n   (b) Per-worker score over time (top-20 firing workers, each a track)\n   (c) Convergence count rolling timeseries (single track: how many workers firing 4-of-4