ubic-bezier bounce effect on the needle movement using CSS animations, you can add the following styles:\n\n```css\n#needle {\n  animation: rotate-needle 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes rotate-needle {\n  from { transform: rotate(-90deg); }\n  to { transform: rotate(90deg); }\n}\n```\n\nThis CSS will animate the needle rotation between -90 degrees and 90 degrees over a period of 2 seconds, creating a smooth bounce effect.\n\n### File Paths\n\n- `src/dashboard/static/tachometer.svg`: This file should contain the SVG code provided above.\n  \nPlease ensure that you have the necessary files and directories set up in your project to accommodate this design. If you need further assistance with implementing these changes or any other details, feel free to ask!"}
